---
title: "Sign in with a token"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Shopper
    participant Web as Storefront
    participant Gate as API gateway
    participant Auth as Auth service

    User->>Web: Sign in with email<br/>[POST /session]
    Web->>Gate: Create session<br/>[POST /session]
    Gate->>Auth: Verify the password<br/>[principal()]
    alt password accepted
        Auth-->>Gate: Principal and scopes
        Gate-->>Web: Session token
        Web-->>User: Signed in
    else rejected
        Gate--)User: 401 with a reason
    end
    opt refresh soon
        Web->>Gate: Refresh the token<br/>[POST /session/refresh]
        Gate-->>Web: A new token
    end
    loop every 5 minutes while the tab is open
        Web->>Gate: Heartbeat<br/>[GET /session]
        Gate-->>Web: Still valid
    end
    Note over Gate,Auth: Credentials never appear in a label
    activate Gate
    Gate->>Auth: Record the sign-in
    deactivate Gate